    "result_text": "All 54 tests pass. **BUILD SUCCESS.**\n\n## Summary\n\nI replaced the level rules with a points system.\n\n**`Owner.java`** \u2014 Added `getMembershipPoints()` and rewrote `getMembershipLevel()`:\n- Points start at 0: `+2` for an email, `+1` when `namesakeCount == 0`, `+2` for a household of 3+ (`householdSize >= 3`), `+3` for tenure over 365 days.\n- Level maps from points: `1` (0\u20131), `2` (2\u20133), `3` (4\u20135), `4` (6+).\n\n**`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added the `membershipPoints` schema field (read-only, driving the generated `OwnerDto` and MapStruct mapping so both fields are returned) and updated `membershipLevel`'s bounds (now max 4) and description.\n\nBoth fields are now returned on the owner resource. A fresh owner with an email and no namesake scores 3 points \u2192 level 2; a household third member with an email scores 5 \u2192 level 3; level 4 requires tenure (6+ points), which a new owner never has \u2014 matching Cp15/Cp23/Cp24/Cp39/Cp40 and the rest of the suite.",
